 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** Lookup is $O(1)$ if the chunk is loaded and the position is valid. If the chunk is not loaded, it depends on the loading mechanism (e.g., disk I/O or streaming latency) [G].
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$ overhead per chunk for the neighbor lookup structure, plus the memory for the chunks themselves. Padded chunks add a fixed overhead of $((S+2)^3 - S^3)$ voxels per chunk [G].
-- **Measured Performance:** Not given in the sources.
